Vibe
====

Vibe is a fork of Mayoi (https://github.com/sorrycc/Mayoi), a small, fast
code editor written in Go.

Mayoi is Copyright (c) 2026 chencheng <sorrycc@gmail.com> and is licensed
under the MIT License. The original copyright notice is retained in LICENSE.

Vibe's changes are Copyright (c) 2026 Vibe contributors, also under the MIT
License.

Third-party components
----------------------

Vibe also includes MyGo, Ghostty's libghostty-vt, creack/pty, MathJax, Pele,
and the Go modules listed in go.mod. Their copyright notices and full
license texts are in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and licenses/.

The information architecture was inspired by vibe-ide, Copyright (c) 2026
luguan, MIT License. No vibe-ide code is compiled into the app.

Vibe is not affiliated with Mayoi, vibe-ide, Ghostty, or the original
vibe-ide project.
